 (&#945;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (&#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>  -  2&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup></p><p>= ((&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>  -  2&#945;&#946;)<sup>2</sup>)  -  2(&#945;&#946;)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>2</sup>  -  2*8)<sup>2</sup>  -  2*8<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 81  -  128</p><p>= &#8722; 47</p><p>So, 1/&#945;<sup>4</sup> + 1/&#946;<sup>4</sup></p><p>= &#8722; 47/8<sup>4</sup></p><p>= &#8722; 47/4096</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x + 8 = 0</p><p>So, &#945; + &#946; = 5 and &#945;&#946; = 8</p><p>1/&#945;<sup>4</sup> + 1/&#946;<sup>4</sup></p><p>= (&#945;<sup>4</sup> + &#946;<sup>4</sup>)/(&#945;&#946;)<sup>4</sup></p><p>&#945;<sup>4</sup> + &#946;<sup>4</sup></p><p>= (&#945;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + (&#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>  -  2&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup></p><p>= ((&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>  -  2&#945;&#946;)<sup>2</sup>)  -  2(&#945;&#946;)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>2</sup>  -  2*8)<sup>2</sup>  -  2*8<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 81  -  128</p><p>= &#8722; 47</p><p>So, 1/&#945;<sup>4</sup> + 1/&#946;<sup>4</sup></p><p>= &#8722; 47/8<sup>4</sup></p><p>= &#8722; 47/4096</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If &#945; and &#946; are roots of the equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  7x  -  2 = 0, then what is the equation whose roots are (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) and (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945; &#2324;&#2352; &#946; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; x<sup>2</sup> - 7x - 2 = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) &#2324;&#2352; (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;) &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["x<sup>2</sup>  -  47x  -  94 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  42x  -  84 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  45x  -  90 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  49x  -  98 = 0"], "options_hi": ["x<sup>2</sup> - 47x - 94 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 42x - 84 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 45x - 90 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 49x - 98 = 0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Given equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  7x  -  2 = 0</p><p>Here, &#945;&#946; = -2 and (&#945; + &#946;) = 7</p><p>Now, (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)(&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;) = &#945;&#946;(&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (-2) * 7<sup>2</sup> = -98</p><p>And, (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;) = (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = 7<sup>2</sup> = 49</p><p>Therefore, the new equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  ((&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;))x + ((&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)(&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;)) = 0</p><p><b>x<sup>2</sup>  -  49x  -  98 = 0</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  7x  -  2 = 0</p><p>Here, &#945;&#946; = -2 and (&#945; + &#946;) = 7</p><p>Now, (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)(&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;) = &#945;&#946;(&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (-2) * 7<sup>2</sup> = -98</p><p>And, (&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;) = (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = 7<sup>2</sup> = 49</p><p>Therefore, the new equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  ((&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;))x + ((&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)(&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ &#945;&#946;)) = 0</p><p><b>x<sup>2</sup>  -  49x  -  98 = 0</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If the roots of the equation px<sup>2</sup> + 2(q + r)x + (p  -  r) = 0 are equal, then what is the value of p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup>?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; px<sup>2</sup> + 2(q + r)x + (p - r) = 0 &#2325;&#2368; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; p<sup>2</sup> - q<sup>2</sup> - r<sup>2 </sup>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["(p + 2q)r", "p + 2q + r", "p(2q + r)", "2pqr"], "options_hi": ["(p + 2q)r", "p + 2q + r", "p(2q + r)", "2pqr"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Since, roots of the equation are equal, then b<sup>2</sup> = 4ac</p><p>[2(q + r)]<sup>2</sup> = 4 * p * (p  -  r)</p><p>4q<sup>2</sup> + 4r<sup>2</sup> + 8qr = 4p<sup>2</sup>  -  4pr</p><p>8qr + 4pr = 4p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q<sup>2</sup>  -  4r<sup>2</sup></p><p>4(2qr + pr) = 4(p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup> = 2qr + pr</p><p>p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup> = (p + 2q)r</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since, roots of the equation are equal, then b<sup>2</sup> = 4ac</p><p>[2(q + r)]<sup>2</sup> = 4 * p * (p  -  r)</p><p>4q<sup>2</sup> + 4r<sup>2</sup> + 8qr = 4p<sup>2</sup>  -  4pr</p><p>8qr + 4pr = 4p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q<sup>2</sup>  -  4r<sup>2</sup></p><p>4(2qr + pr) = 4(p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup> = 2qr + pr</p><p>p<sup>2</sup>  -  q<sup>2</sup>  -  r<sup>2</sup> = (p + 2q)r</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If &#945; and &#946; are the roots of equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  &radic;17x + 4 = 0, then which of the following equation has roots (&#945;<sup> </sup> -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> and '4&#945;&#946;'?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> - &radic;17x + 4 = 0 &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#945; &#2324;&#2352; &#946; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; (&#945;<sup> </sup>- &#946;)<sup>2</sup> &#2324;&#2352; '4&#945;&#946;' &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["x<sup>2</sup>  -  16x + 17 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  &radic;17x + 16 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  &radic;17x + 4 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  17x + 16 = 0"], "options_hi": ["x<sup>2</sup> - 16x + 17 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - &radic;17x + 16 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - &radic;17x + 4 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 17x + 16 = 0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Given equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  &radic;17x + 4 = 0</p><p>Sum of roots = &#945; + &#946; = -b/a = &radic;17</p><p>Product of roots = &#945;&#946; = c/a = 4</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>  -  4&#945;&#946;</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;17)<sup>2</sup>  -  4 * 4</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = 17  -  16 = 1</p><p>&#945;  -  &#946; = 1</p><p>Equation that has the roots (&#945;<sup> </sup> -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> and '4&#945;&#946;'= x<sup>2</sup>  -  Sum of roots * x + Product of roots = 0</p><p>Sum of roots = (&#945;<sup> </sup> -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> + 4&#945;&#946; = 1<sup>2</sup> + 4*4 = 17</p><p>Product of roots = (&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> * 4&#945;&#946; = 1 * 4 * 4 = 16</p><p>Required equation = x<sup>2</sup>  -  17x + 16 = 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given equation: x<sup>2</sup>  -  &radic;17x + 4 = 0</p><p>Sum of roots = &#945; + &#946; = -b/a = &radic;17</p><p>Product of roots = &#945;&#946; = c/a = 4</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>  -  4&#945;&#946;</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;17)<sup>2</sup>  -  4 * 4</p><p>(&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = 17  -  16 = 1</p><p>&#945;  -  &#946; = 1</p><p>Equation that has the roots (&#945;<sup> </sup> -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> and '4&#945;&#946;'= x<sup>2</sup>  -  Sum of roots * x + Product of roots = 0</p><p>Sum of roots = (&#945;<sup> </sup> -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> + 4&#945;&#946; = 1<sup>2</sup> + 4*4 = 17</p><p>Product of roots = (&#945;  -  &#946;)<sup>2</sup> * 4&#945;&#946; = 1 * 4 * 4 = 16</p><p>Required equation = x<sup>2</sup>  -  17x + 16 = 0</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If 2x<sup>2</sup> -5x + 2 = 0, and x &lt; 1, then find the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2x<sup>2</sup>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2x<sup>2</sup> -5x + 2 = 0 &#2324;&#2352; x &lt; 1 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2x<sup>2</sup>", "options_en": ["0", "1", "-1", "-2"], "options_hi": ["0", "1", "-1", "-2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Given,</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup> -5x + 2 = 0</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x  -  x + 2 =0</p><p>2x(x  -  2) -1(x  -  2) = 0</p><p>(2x  -  1)(x  -  2) = 0</p><p>X = 2 or 1/2</p><p>Since X&lt;1, so, X should be equal to 1/2.</p><p>Now,</p><p>(2x<sup>2</sup>)/(x  -  1)</p><p>= {2 * (1/4)}/(-1/2)</p><p>= (1/2)/(-1/2) = -1.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given,</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup> -5x + 2 = 0</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x  -  x + 2 =0</p><p>2x(x  -  2) -1(x  -  2) = 0</p><p>(2x  -  1)(x  -  2) = 0</p><p>X = 2 or 1/2</p><p>Since X&lt;1, so, X should be equal to 1/2.</p><p>Now,</p><p>(2x<sup>2</sup>)/(x  -  1)</p><p>= {2 * (1/4)}/(-1/2)</p><p>= (1/2)/(-1/2) = -1.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<div>&nbsp;If &#945;<sup>2</sup> and &#946;<sup>2</sup> are the roots of equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  px + q = 0, then what is the value of (<div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945;<sup>2</sup> &#2324;&#2352; &#946;<sup>2</sup> , &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; x<sup>2</sup> - px + q = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; (1/&#945;<sup>2</sup>) + (1/&#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2</sup> - &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["(p  -  p<sup>2</sup>q  -  4q<sup>2</sup>)/q<sup>2</sup>", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q + 4q<sup>2</sup>)/q", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q  -  4q<sup>2</sup>)", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q  -  4q<sup>2</sup>)/q"], "options_hi": ["(p - p<sup>2</sup>q - 4q<sup>2</sup>)/q<sup>2</sup>", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q + 4q<sup>2</sup>)/q", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q - 4q<sup>2</sup>)", "(p + p<sup>2</sup>q - 4q<sup>2</sup>)/q"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Since, &#945;<sup>2</sup> and &#946;<sup>2</sup> are the roots of equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  px + q = 0.</p><p>So,</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> = p</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup> = q</p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>  -  4&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup></p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = (p)<sup>2</sup>  -  4 * q</p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q</p><p>And, (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2 </sup>= p/q</p><p>(1/&#945;<sup>2</sup>) + (1/&#946;<sup>2</sup>) = p/q</p><p>Now,</p><p>= (1/&#945;<sup>2</sup>) + (1/&#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (p/q) + p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q</p><p>= (p + p<sup>2</sup>q  -  4q<sup>2</sup>)/q</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since, &#945;<sup>2</sup> and &#946;<sup>2</sup> are the roots of equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  px + q = 0.</p><p>So,</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> = p</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup> = q</p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>  -  4&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2</sup></p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = (p)<sup>2</sup>  -  4 * q</p><p>(&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q</p><p>And, (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/&#945;<sup>2</sup>&#946;<sup>2 </sup>= p/q</p><p>(1/&#945;<sup>2</sup>) + (1/&#946;<sup>2</sup>) = p/q</p><p>Now,</p><p>= (1/&#945;<sup>2</sup>) + (1/&#946;<sup>2</sup>) + (&#945;<sup>2</sup>  -  &#946;<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= (p/q) + p<sup>2</sup>  -  4q</p><p>= (p + p<sup>2</sup>q  -  4q<sup>2</sup>)/q</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If P =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 21", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 21", "options_en": ["(x+1)/(x+9)", "1", "0", "(x + 7)/(x  -  5)"], "options_hi": ["(x+1)/(x+9)", "1", "0", "(x + 7)/(x - 5)"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=296 height=133 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p14931/image005.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=296 height=133 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p14931/image005.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}